# Flutter regenerates these on every `pub get` and every build, and they carry
# absolute, per-host paths: the Linux lane writes /opt/flutter + /workspace,
# the Windows container writes C:\ProgramData\... + C:\ws-mnt. Tracked, they
# flipped back and forth on every lane switch (AGENTS.md § 5). The files say
# "do not edit or check into version control" themselves.
ios/Flutter/Generated.xcconfig
ios/Flutter/flutter_export_environment.sh
ios/Flutter/ephemeral/flutter_native_integration.env
macos/Flutter/ephemeral/Flutter-Generated.xcconfig
macos/Flutter/ephemeral/flutter_export_environment.sh
macos/Flutter/ephemeral/flutter_native_integration.env

# docs/ is Markdown source only since the unused Sphinx scaffolding
# (docs/Makefile, docs/make.bat, docs/source/conf.py, docs/source/index.rst)
# was deleted on 2026-09-15 — nothing in this repo ever built a Sphinx site.
# The rule stays so a stray local `sphinx-build -b html docs/source docs/build`
# cannot put rendered HTML back into the tree.
docs/build/*

# Agentic-loop role prompts for the opencode engine, GENERATED from
# ANTfrastructure's shared system prompt + scripts/agentic-loop/prompts/*-overlay.md.
# A build artefact - edit the overlay, never this.
.opencode/agents/
